
0.6: New note in SPA

mermaid

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant Server

    User->>Browser: Writes a new note
    User->>Browser: Presses Save button
    Note right of Browser: JavaScript prevents default form submission
    Browser->>Server: POST /new_note_spa (new note as JSON)
    Server-->>Browser: 201 Created
    Note right of Browser: JavaScript updates the notes list
    Browser-->>User: Displays the new note without reloading the page
